    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gather the flock and fluff your feathers for a fly new chatroom sandbox experience!</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soar and Explore a Vibrant Open-World Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Mourning Duck Island</i>, a land of opportunity where you\u2019ll take flight, dive deep, and waddle your way through a mysterious world full of secrets and treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather, Trade, and Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around these parts, bread is more than just food; it's money! Acquire bread and materials to expand your very own nest, a fully customizable home. Discover and build unique interactables to improve your gathering, enhance exploration, or just have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glide, Slide, Dive, and Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mourning Duck Island is your playground! With a range of fluid movement mechanics, explore land, air, and sea in whatever way you desire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Multiplayer Sandbox Full of Quacky Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in this open-world multiplayer sandbox! Ride pedal-powered boats together, place interactive objects to help with gathering, and explore cooperatively. Whether you're gliding side by side, diving for treasure, or just goofing around, there\u2019s always fun to be had!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and nurture a flock of loyal ducklings to gather materials and uncover hidden treasures. Customize each one to create the ultimate squad of resourceful little hatchlings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Brood, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with unlockable cosmetics for both your duck and ducklings. From stylish feathers to quirky outfits and hats, make your ducks truly stand out in the flock!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gather the flock and fluff your feathers for a fly new chatroom sandbox experience!</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soar and Explore a Vibrant Open-World Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Mourning Duck Island</i>, a land of opportunity where you\u2019ll take flight, dive deep, and waddle your way through a mysterious world full of secrets and treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather, Trade, and Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around these parts, bread is more than just food; it's money! Acquire bread and materials to expand your very own nest, a fully customizable home. Discover and build unique interactables to improve your gathering, enhance exploration, or just have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glide, Slide, Dive, and Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mourning Duck Island is your playground! With a range of fluid movement mechanics, explore land, air, and sea in whatever way you desire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Multiplayer Sandbox Full of Quacky Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in this open-world multiplayer sandbox! Ride pedal-powered boats together, place interactive objects to help with gathering, and explore cooperatively. Whether you're gliding side by side, diving for treasure, or just goofing around, there\u2019s always fun to be had!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and nurture a flock of loyal ducklings to gather materials and uncover hidden treasures. Customize each one to create the ultimate squad of resourceful little hatchlings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Brood, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with unlockable cosmetics for both your duck and ducklings. From stylish feathers to quirky outfits and hats, make your ducks truly stand out in the flock!</p>",
    "short_description": "Soar, dive, and waddle your way through Mourning Duck Island! Gather resources, trade, and build a customizable nest while exploring with friends in this multiplayer sandbox. Raise a flock of ducklings, customize your ducks, and embark on fun adventures together!",
